OL,4,CZimbabwe issues arrest warrant for     
OL,5,CRobert Mugabe's son over missed court  
OL,6,Cdate                                   
OL,7,GA Zimbabwean court has issued an       
OL,8,Garrest warrant for Bellarmine Chatunga 
OL,9,GMugabe, the youngest son of the        
OL,10,Gcountry's late former president Robert 
OL,11,GMugabe, after he failed to appear in   
OL,12,Gcourt.                                 
OL,14,FMugabe was arrested earlier this month 
OL,15,Falongside four others over assault     
OL,16,Fallegations on a police officer during 
OL,17,Fan investigation into the suspected    
OL,18,Fsmuggling of luxury vehicles.          
OL,20,FThe group subsequently faced charges   
OL,21,Fof robbery and malicious damage to     
OL,22,Fproperty. They have yet to enter pleas.
